sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Frontend as Frontend Admin
    participant AdminService as admin-service
    participant LangGraph as Orchestration LangGraph
    participant ToolA as Service / Outil 1
    participant ToolB as Service / Outil 2
    participant ToolC as Service / Outil 3

    Admin->>Frontend: Soumettre une demande complexe
    Frontend->>AdminService: Envoyer la demande
    AdminService->>LangGraph: Demarrer le workflow
    LangGraph->>LangGraph: Detecter un scenario multi-etapes

    LangGraph->>ToolA: Executer etape 1
    ToolA-->>LangGraph: Resultat etape 1
    LangGraph->>ToolB: Executer etape 2
    ToolB-->>LangGraph: Resultat etape 2

    opt Etape supplementaire requise
        LangGraph->>ToolC: Executer etape 3
        ToolC-->>LangGraph: Resultat etape 3
    end

    LangGraph->>LangGraph: Agreger les resultats
    LangGraph-->>AdminService: Synthese du workflow
    AdminService-->>Frontend: Retourner l'etat final
    Frontend-->>Admin: Afficher la reponse multi-etapes
